{"1962130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CubeLoop", "steam_appid": 1962130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<strong>CubeLoop</strong> is a first-person puzzle game that you can play alone or cooperatively online. Find out what riddle the room hides and escape or die trying.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/f99c430e62d1f908da386333001bf647.poster.avif?t=1662637316\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/f99c430e62d1f908da386333001bf647.webm?t=1662637316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/f99c430e62d1f908da386333001bf647.mp4?t=1662637316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online cooperation</h2>All rooms can be played collaboratively.<br><br>Call your Steam friends and let the fun begin.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/463f956e92fd2277f0e92ca1643e72ef.poster.avif?t=1662637316\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/463f956e92fd2277f0e92ca1643e72ef.webm?t=1662637316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/463f956e92fd2277f0e92ca1643e72ef.mp4?t=1662637316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve logic-based puzzles</h2>All puzzles are randomly generated using an algorithm that ensures they can be solved logically.<br><br>And don't worry. All games are replayable and are meant to be completed in multiplayer or single player.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/d5e9ec63f7c585cd95ca92f22a637993.poster.avif?t=1662637316\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/d5e9ec63f7c585cd95ca92f22a637993.webm?t=1662637316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/d5e9ec63f7c585cd95ca92f22a637993.mp4?t=1662637316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy the mysterious setting</h2>.<br>In <strong>CubeLoop</strong> you are condemned to live in an infinite Loop and the only escape from reality is a slide that seems to be connected to the paintings adorning the walls of your cell.<br><br>Entertainment will cost you dearly as every mistake can cost you your life... and something that will hurt you more than your life.<br><br>Getting your bearings won't be easy as all the levels are mazes that will try to rob you of what little sanity you have left.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No distractions</h2>No interface, no menus, everything is integrated into the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/52589caec623a7f7350cf6e6167db86b.poster.avif?t=1662637316\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/52589caec623a7f7350cf6e6167db86b.webm?t=1662637316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/52589caec623a7f7350cf6e6167db86b.mp4?t=1662637316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>CubeLoop</strong> is a completely immersive game, where only cold <strong>logic</strong> can save you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/42ff82afbcb1af8c59f4036be82ae3f8.poster.avif?t=1662637316\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/42ff82afbcb1af8c59f4036be82ae3f8.webm?t=1662637316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/42ff82afbcb1af8c59f4036be82ae3f8.mp4?t=1662637316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<strong>CubeLoop</strong> is a first-person puzzle game that you can play alone or cooperatively online. Find out what riddle the room hides and escape or die trying.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/f99c430e62d1f908da386333001bf647.poster.avif?t=1662637316\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/f99c430e62d1f908da386333001bf647.webm?t=1662637316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/f99c430e62d1f908da386333001bf647.mp4?t=1662637316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online cooperation</h2>All rooms can be played collaboratively.<br><br>Call your Steam friends and let the fun begin.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/463f956e92fd2277f0e92ca1643e72ef.poster.avif?t=1662637316\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962130/extras/463f956e92fd2277f0e92ca1643e72ef.webm?t=1662637316\" type=\"video/w